# Logs
# Anchored to the project root: a bare `logs` matches at any depth, which
# silently swallowed `src/features/logs/` — four source modules the audit trail
# and the control board's activity panel import. Only the runtime log directory
# Vite/npm write at the root is meant to be ignored here.
/logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Build/coverage
coverage
dev-dist
